n average speed of <math alttext=\"20.300\"><mn>20.300</mn></math> miles per hour. What was this average speed, in <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">yards</span> per hour? <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 mile  equals 1,760 yards right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1,760</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>yards</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>","externalid":"d2f59729-f3aa-4681-adb0-ddf2309976b8","templateid":"54f0fba1-f08d-44fe-838f-9ae1bb6e8ae8","vaultid":"f67afa4b-2bba-47fb-a0e0-ee2bc786739e","type":"spr","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["35728"]},"createDate":1691007959830,"updateDate":1691007959830}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959830, 1691007959830),
